  "description": "Above the Grade is a bold balloon-style display font that captures the raw, playful energy of classic bubble graffiti — the kind of inflated, rounded lettering you’d spot spray-painted on subway cars, skate decks, and old-school hip-hop flyers. Hand-drawn by Namara Creative, every letterform is shaped with soft, oversized curves that give your typography a fun, three-dimensional “throw-up” feel while staying clean enough for professional design work.\nAbove the Grade is built for designers who want their type to talk street without losing polish. Bold, bubbly, and endlessly layerable, it’s the graffiti font that turns any headline, logo, or print into something people stop to look at twice. Grab it today and put your next project above the grade.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Above the Grade is a bold balloon-style display font that captures the raw, playful energy of classic bubble graffiti — the kind of inflated, rounded lettering you’d spot spray-painted on subway cars, skate decks, and old-school hip-hop flyers. Hand-drawn by Namara Creative, every letterform is shaped with soft, oversized curves that give your typography a fun, three-dimensional “throw-up” feel while staying clean enough for professional design work.</p>\n<p>Above the Grade is built for designers who want their type to talk street without losing polish. Bold, bubbly, and endlessly layerable, it’s the graffiti font that turns any headline, logo, or print into something people stop to look at twice. Grab it today and put your next project above the grade.</p>",
